<title>JAPAN: Hino Motors - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hino Motors - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		286.24		vs	  306.57</p>
<p> Operating	    3.78		vs	    8.02</p>
<p> Current		4.71		vs	    7.08</p>
<p> Net		    2.79		vs	    3.75</p>
<p> EPS		    7.70 yen	  vs	   10.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    362 million	  vs	 362 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hino Motors Ltd is a leading truck manufacturer.</p>
